# Use LF line endings in the working copy on every OS.
# The repository is stored in LF, Prettier writes LF (endOfLine: "lf") and so
# does the route generator (routeTree.gen.ts). With core.autocrlf on Windows,
# Git checked files out as CRLF, so every formatted or regenerated file showed
# up as modified without any real change.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files are never converted
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.mp4 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
